{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2021-11-02 16:30:00', 'title': 'INTERPUBLIC DECLARES COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK, NOV. 02, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0 INTERPUBLIC GROUP (NYSE: IPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON IPG COMMON STOCK OF $0.27 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 15, 2021, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 1, 2021."}